# The INT8 checkpoint (~92 MB raw, ~66.6 MB as shipped) is included in BOTH the sdist
# and the wheel so that `pip install sahu65` works with no download step and no
# cold-start stall, and so that a source install also works.
#
# Do NOT add an `exclude sahu65/models/classifier.int8.onnx` line to keep the sdist
# small. It appears to scope to the sdist only, but setuptools also applies it when
# building the wheel, which silently strips the checkpoint from the wheel and produces a
# package that cannot run. Verified: with the exclude, the wheel was 37 KB with no model.
#
# Both artifacts land at ~66.6 MB, comfortably under PyPI's 100 MB per-file limit.
include README.md
include LICENSE
include MODEL_CARD.md
include requirements.txt
recursive-include sahu65 *.py
recursive-include sahu65/models *.onnx *.json
recursive-include sahu65/config *.json
prune tests
prune scripts
prune assets
prune models
prune .venv
global-exclude __pycache__ *.pyc
